---
import LogoCarousel from './LogoCarousel.astro';
---
<section class="proof-section" aria-labelledby="proof-heading">
  <div class="wrap proof-band">
    <div class="proof-lead">
      <p class="proof-label">Where initiatives stall</p>
      <h2 id="proof-heading">Access to AI tools is rarely the real blocker.</h2>
      <p>Value usually stalls where expectations are weak, workflows are still pre-AI, and shared context is too thin for people or agents to produce work the team can trust.</p>
    </div>
    <LogoCarousel />
    <ol class="pressure-list">
      <li class="pressure-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Expectations drift from real delivery</h3>
          <p>Teams get access to models and tools without a shared bar for what useful AI work should actually produce.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="pressure-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Pre-AI processes absorb the gains</h3>
          <p>Old workflow structure turns new model capacity into more reporting, more handoffs, and more management overhead.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="pressure-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Context and ownership stay too weak</h3>
          <p>Without writable context, validation, and a real quality bar, teams spend more time cleaning up than compounding value.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
